The examples test the Sauce Labs "My Demo App" (https://github.com/saucelabs/my-demo-app-android and
https://github.com/saucelabs/my-demo-app-ios). The app binaries are NOT included in this repository:
scripts/download-apps.* downloads them from the official Sauce Labs releases. Locators in the example screens
reference identifiers defined by those apps.
